WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.750
Studio Ghibli has something for everyone,
whether it's a fantastical adventure, drama,

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.320
or romance.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:11.480
In celebration of this vast collection of
animated works, here is a ranking of all of

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.860
Ghibli's feature-length films from worst to
best.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.440
Tales from Earthsea follows an exiled prince
and a wandering wizard, as they navigate a

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.680
fantasy world.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:27.500
While some scenes in the film look absolutely
gorgeous, the overall visual quality of the

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.940
film lacks consistency.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.100
The film still looks like a Studio Ghibli
film, but it lacks the sense of life that

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.420
characterizes other films from the famous
animation studio.

00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:41.720
In addition, the plot incorporates elements
from several of the Earthsea books and suffers

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:42.400
as a result.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.680
Tales from Earthsea feels at once bloated
with plot points and characters while also

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.320
starved of depth since there's not enough
time to explore each concept.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:56.800
The sprawling plot and the shallow character
motivations all end up making Tales from Earthsea

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.520
the weakest Studio Ghibli film by far.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.940
My Neighbors the Yamadas is a comedy in the
style of a Japanese comic strip.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.480
The film is a compilation of stories following
members of the Yamada family.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:13.460
In each segment, different issues are explored,
like disputes between the married couple and

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.460
the various relationships of the family members.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:21.600
Though My Neighbors the Yamadas is an inoffensive
and entertaining watch, the film simply pales

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.120
in comparison to other Studio Ghibli titles.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:29.420
It's definitely not the most impressive entry
in the studio's long history, but My Neighbors

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:33.850
the Yamadas is a cute film with comedic elements
that many viewers are bound to enjoy.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:39.909
From Up on Poppy Hill follows Umi Matsuzaki,
a high school student in the port city of

00:01:39.909 --> 00:01:40.600
Yokohama.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:45.700
Each morning outside of the boarding house
where she lives, Umi raises a series of signal

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.399
flags in honor of her father, who died during
the Korean War.

00:01:49.399 --> 00:01:54.329
One day, she meets a boy who wrote about her
flags in his student newspaper, and the two

00:01:54.329 --> 00:01:58.280
set about renovating the building where the
school clubs are supposed to be held.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:03.090
The pair begin to fall for each other as they
continue working on the renovation, even after

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:05.780
the school board decides to demolish the building.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.200
The setting is perhaps where the film shines
the brightest.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:14.340
While the city of Yokohama isn't a fantastical
setting for a film, the film nearly makes

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:18.159
it seem fantastical by paying special attention
to the time period.

00:02:18.159 --> 00:02:24.280
The story takes place in 1963 as the nation
gets ready to host the 1964 Olympic Games,

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:28.200
and the little touches throughout the film
help to ground the story in a specific time

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:28.880
and place.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:34.030
From Up on Poppy Hill isn't a bad film overall,
but the film's mundane setting and somewhat

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:36.260
predictable plot weaken the experience.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:41.880
"It's not a young kid story, it's not a magical
story like Ponyo, but there's a beauty to

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.940
it because it's animated."

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:50.060
Porco Rosso follows a former Italian fighter
pilot who is cursed to look like an anthropomorphic

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:50.560
pig.

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:55.520
After the First World War, Porco makes it
his duty to hunt down air-pirates who use

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.180
their planes to wreak havoc on honest people.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.900
But when a young pirate shoots his aircraft
down, Porco has to make a dangerous journey

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.000
to his mechanic so he can repair his plane.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:11.060
Porco Rosso is a lighthearted action film
that goes to great lengths to show Hayao Miyazaki's

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.920
admiration of early aviation.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.560
There are a lot of shots of Porco operating
his plane with the use of several levers,

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.720
sticks, and pedals that highlights the film's
attention to detail.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:25.560
While the story is relatively safe, the real
draw of this film is the action during the

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:26.700
mid-air dogfights.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.940
Though not as groundbreaking as other Studio
Ghibli titles, Porco Rosso still has plenty

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.200
to offer as a film.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:39.660
The Wind Rises is a fictionalized biography
of Jiro Horikoshi, a renowned Japanese airplane

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.760
designer from the early 20th century.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:47.220
The film follows Jiro as he falls in love
with his terminally ill wife, and finds fulfillment

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.660
in designing planes.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:53.460
However, throughout the film, Jiro worries
about the ethics surrounding his invention,

00:03:53.469 --> 00:03:56.629
since he primarily develops them for the Japanese
military.

00:03:56.629 --> 00:04:01.620
The Wind Rises centers on a prominent historical
figure who many Americans have likely never

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:02.180
heard of.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:06.680
While that could have been interesting on
its own, the film unfortunately suffers from

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.820
pacing problems that make The Wind Rises feel
dragged out.

00:04:10.349 --> 00:04:15.620
Still, for history buffs and fans of aviation,
The Wind Rises is likely to soar to the top

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.300
of your favorite movie lists.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:23.340
"Airplanes are beautiful dreams, engineered
to turn dreams into reality."

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:24.780
"Yes."

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:26.340
"Arrividerci!"

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:32.210
In Pom Poko, construction on the outskirts
of Tokyo has led to the surrounding forest

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.720
becoming drained of its natural resources.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:41.110
As the threat of deforestation looms, magical
creatures known as tanuki take desperate measures.

00:04:41.110 --> 00:04:46.180
They begin staging elaborate hauntings to
scare humans, attracting media attention,

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.220
and even relying on eco-terrorism to stall
construction.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:54.060
Pom Poko is an environmentally conscious film
that aims to highlight the plight of animals

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.740
rapidly losing their lands to suburban development.

00:04:57.720 --> 00:05:03.259
Despite some heavy-handed themes and awkward
pacing, the film has plenty of fun, expressive

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.480
animation that still makes Pom Poko an engaging
watch.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:12.260
Similar to The Little Mermaid, Ponyo is a
cute love story about a fish-girl named Ponyo

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:16.880
who befriends Sosuke, a human boy, when she
strays away from home.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:23.030
Ponyo is a genuinely beautiful film with amazingly
creative designs, both in terms of world-building

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.220
and characters.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:28.120
However, it suffers from slow pacing and an
overly simple story.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:34.080
That being said, Ponyo isn't aiming for depth;
the film wants to take viewers on a fantastical

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.940
visual journey under the sea, and in that
respect, it excels.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:42.919
Though it isn't perfect, Ponyo is more than
worth watching for the gorgeous animation

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:46.420
and cute childish romance between Sosuke and
Ponyo.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:53.040
After Haru Yoshioka saves the life of a cat
crossing the street, her life takes a turn

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:57.460
for the weird when the cat turns out to be
the prince of Cat Kingdom and asks for her

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.680
hand in marriage.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:03.760
With a fantastical premise, The Cat Returns
is a cute fantasy adventure that's plenty

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:04.810
of fun to watch.

00:06:04.810 --> 00:06:09.331
Still, the film lacks the grand scope that
has come to be expected from Studio Ghibli

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:09.860
titles.

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:15.080
Compared to the visual masterpiece of Spirited
Away, which was released during the same year

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:20.419
as The Cat Returns, the latter film is both
lighter in tone and bit less daring in terms

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.440
of animation.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:26.660
Still, the film is definitely enjoyable on
its own merits, and is an overall solid flick

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.220
for animation fans and cat lovers alike.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:36.100
"Hi, Charlie Kelly here, local business owner
and cat enthusiast!"

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:41.420
When Marnie Was There follows Anna, a young
girl sent to live with her foster parents'

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.780
family in Hokkaido due to her poor health.

00:06:44.180 --> 00:06:49.990
Anna is lonely and depressed until she meets
a strangely familiar girl named Marnie, a

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:53.680
mysterious blond girl living in a dilapidated
old house in the marshes.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:59.140
The true strength of When Marnie Was There
lies largely in its interesting female leads.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:03.740
Anna has trouble connecting with others and
considers herself an outlier in her society.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:09.200
Given this, the relationship that develops
between Anna and Marnie is incredibly sincere

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.160
as it develops throughout, giving Anna someone
that she can finally relate to.

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:18.560
In the end, the great connection shared by
the two leads, the mystery surrounding Marnie's

00:07:18.569 --> 00:07:23.039
character, and the film's impressive animation
all come together to create a satisfying and

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.180
relatable film.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:28.480
"In my dreams, I saw a girl just like you."

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:30.080
"Dreams.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:30.880
Hmm."

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:37.300
Howl's Moving Castle follows Sophie, a hatmaker
who is cursed to look like an old woman by

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:37.880
a witch.

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:43.300
While traveling to find a way to break the
witch's spell, Sophie meets an enchanted scarecrow

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:47.620
and seeks out Howl, a wizard who lives in
a magical moving castle.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:52.939
Miyazaki's works are always filled with commentaries
on how humans interact with nature, staying

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.800
true to the creator's passion for taking care
of the environment.

00:07:56.220 --> 00:08:00.720
However, Howl's Moving Castle also focuses
around how humans interact and bond with each

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.220
other.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:07.280
In conveying this theme, Howl's Moving Castle
considers complicated topics such as war,

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.250
loyalty to nations, and coming to terms with
aging.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:15.720
The unique variety of themes combines with
the now-standard fare of breathtaking animation,

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.020
fun characters, and plenty of humor.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:23.380
All together, it makes Howl's Moving Castle
one of the most inventive Studio Ghibli films

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:23.880
around.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:29.520
The princess of the Valley of the Wind is
Nausicaä, an adventurous young woman who

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:35.120
wants her people to coexist with the neighboring
Toxic Jungle and its animal and insect inhabitants.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.640
However, the peace of the Valley is put at
risk when a plane from a neighboring country

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:40.860
crashes in the Valley.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:47.740
The plane's cargo harbors the embryo of a
Giant Warrior, an enormous and dangerous insect

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.370
that will be used to destroy the Toxic Jungle.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:55.230
Everything falls to Nausicaä to find a way
to restore peace to both lands and find harmony

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:56.840
between nature and humans.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:02.140
Nausicaä of the Valley of the Wind is one
of Hayao Miyazaki's most environmentally conscious

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.540
features, and one that's clearly close to
his heart.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:09.610
The film was created before Studio Ghibli's
existence, but the success of Nausicaä is

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.400
what led to the studio's creation.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:16.300
Without Nausicaä, it is fair to assume we
may not have gotten many of the Studio Ghibli

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.920
titles that we have today.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:23.380
Even beyond its place in the Studio's history,
Nausicaa is breathtakingly original, with

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:27.520
all of the unique character designs and luscious
animation that you would expect.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:33.860
In Whisper of the Heart, Shizuki is a student
about to take her high school entrance exams.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:39.860
She soon meets Seiji, a talented musician
who dreams of becoming a master violin maker.

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:45.240
Seiji leaves for Italy to follow his dreams,
while Shizuki decides to devote herself to

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:45.740
writing.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.680
While other Studio Ghibli films may stand
out for their lush environments or their tense

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:55.410
action scenes, Whisper of the Heart's strength
is the emotional journey that the Shizuki

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:56.700
goes on throughout the film.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:02.220
Whisper of the Heart is impressive in how
it tackles the creative process and the struggles

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:05.580
of balancing creative endeavors with more
traditional pursuits.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:10.320
The film is relatable and down to earth, making
Whisper of the Heart one of the more uniquely

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:12.380
mundane films from the studio.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:18.279
Initially released in 1993, Ocean Waves is
a bit different from other Studio Ghibli titles

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.709
in that it was originally produced for television.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:26.680
Additionally, it's the first Ghibli film not
to feature Hayao Miyazaki or Isao Takahata

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.580
as director.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:34.160
Ocean Waves tells the story of a love triangle
between Taku, his best friend Yutaka, and

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.120
the new exchange student Rikaku.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:42.000
After Taku joins Rikaku for an unexpected
trip to Tokyo, tensions rise, and rumors begin

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.820
to develop about Rikaku and Taku's relationship.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:50.400
As a result, Rikaku, Taku, and Yutaka must
confront the change in dynamics and the nature

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.140
of their relationships with one another.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:57.080
For a teenage love story, the overall likable
Ocean Waves is generally pretty good.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:02.780
Though it may not be as strong as similar
Studio Ghibli films, it's a solid, engaging

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.280
drama.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:09.580
After moving closer to their hospital-bound
mother, sisters Satsuki and Mei discover a

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:12.520
host of magical beings living in their new
town.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:18.680
Guided by friendly dust creatures, Mei meets
Totoro, a giant cat-like animal that lives

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.120
in a hollow by the girl's house.

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:25.670
Eventually, Totoro also reveals himself to
Satsuki, and the sisters are introduced to

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:29.100
the whimsical life shared by Totoro and his
fantastical friends.

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:33.460
Though the film is mostly filled with cute
critters and upbeat interactions between Satsuki

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:36.960
and her younger sister, it also has its fair
share of tension.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:42.340
My Neighbor Totoro is wildly fun to watch,
and instills a sense of childlike wonder that

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.960
few other films can achieve.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:49.840
Considering Castle in the Sky was the first
film to be produced under the name Studio

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:53.760
Ghibli in 1986, it stands the test of time
incredibly well.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:59.220
The story begins with Sheeta, a young orphan
pursued by space pirates and government officials

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:00.760
for her mysterious necklace.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:04.940
Sheeta is found and sheltered by another orphan
named Pazu.

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:10.040
The two go on a journey to uncover the secrets
of Sheeta's necklace and its airborne origin.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:15.160
Castle in the Sky does a good job of setting
the tone for future Studio Ghibli films in

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:20.380
that it has a sweeping soundtrack, a mystical
world filled with advanced technology, and

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:23.200
themes surrounding humans and their relationship
to nature.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:28.230
While better Ghibli films would come later,
Castle in the Sky remains a standout in the

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.060
studio's history.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:34.820
The Secret World of Arrietty film follows
a family of borrowers, tiny people who scavenge

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:37.640
or borrow from the houses of ordinary humans.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:42.990
The family's safety is threatened when the
young boy of the house, Sho, sees Arrietty

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.580
while she and her father are borrowing in
his room late one night.

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:51.040
While Studio Ghibli films are renowned for
their ability to create fantastical worlds,

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:56.140
The Secret World of Arrietty engenders that
same sense of wonder, scope, and adventure

00:12:56.140 --> 00:12:57.800
within its utterly normal setting.

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:03.600
In addition to beautiful animation and excellent
art design, the film has a lovely soundtrack

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:06.280
that helps build on the sweet overall tone.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:11.820
With a blend of fantastic music and visuals,
The Secret World of Arrietty is a beautiful

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:16.850
tale of blossoming friendship that perfectly
balances between a calm, slice-of-life narrative

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.500
and a fun adventure story.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:23.980
"I am very proud of you.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:27.160
A lesser borrower would have panicked and
run away."

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:33.940
In Princess Mononoke, Prince Ashitaka finds
himself poisoned after a demon attacks his

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:34.440
village.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:39.380
In search of a cure, Ashitaka goes to Iron
Town, where the people cut down the forest

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.580
to fuel their manufacturing-based society.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:46.620
This disturbance of nature upsets the spirits
of the forest, who go to war with the people

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:47.440
of Iron Town.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:52.700
As the war threatens to wipe out both the
nature spirits and the humans, Ashitaka and

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:57.640
San, a human raised by spirits, must work
together to achieve some form of peace.

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:02.460
One of Ghibli's most well-known pictures,
Princess Mononoke does an excellent job of

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:06.240
blending an action-packed adventure with a
nuanced environmental message.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:11.680
Kiki's Delivery Service follows a young witch
named Kiki as she leaves her home and begins

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.540
her training as a witch in a new town.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.800
Supported by her talking black cat Jiji, she
flies to a seaside town where she's hosted

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:20.980
by a friendly baker and her husband.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:26.120
Quickly, Kiki finds her footing as a delivery
girl and captures the attention of a boy named

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.340
Tombo, who clamors for her attention.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:33.020
Kiki's Delivery Service is a magical tale
with beautiful animation that makes the film's

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:34.800
world feel warm and idyllic.

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:40.460
All of the characters are expressive and relatable,
especially Kiki, who struggles to fit into

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.680
her new town and discover her unique talents.

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:48.660
Starting as over-confident and slowly becoming
isolated and unsure, Kiki is a brilliantly

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:53.340
fleshed-out character that encourages viewers
to overcome obstacles and fly high.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:59.079
Only Yesterday strays away from Studio Ghibli
conventions by targeting older viewers as

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.900
opposed to teens and children.

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:06.180
The film explores the life of Taeko Okajima,
an unmarried woman who takes a trip outside

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:08.260
of Tokyo to the rural countryside.

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:14.380
Outside the city, Taeko begins to feel nostalgia
for her childhood and questions her life choices.

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:19.580
Because of Only Yesterday's focus on an adult
protagonist and her growing disillusionment

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:23.620
with her life, the film offers a mature and
reflective exploration of aging.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:27.360
Unlike many other Ghibli titles, there's no
magical adventures.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:32.380
Instead, the story of Only Yesterday offers
a slice of life experience that is grounded

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:32.980
in reality.

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:37.880
The film does an excellent job of fleshing
out Taeko's memories and allows her to come

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:40.860
to terms with who she is and what she wants
out of life.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:46.460
Only Yesterday has a unique charm and relays
a beautiful story of growth, reflection, and

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:47.620
self-discovery.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:54.319
"This scenery has come about by accident as
people have struggled to get what they needed

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:55.000
to survive."

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:01.380
With a distinct watercolor aesthetic, The
Tale of the Princess Kaguya is a beautifully

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:04.760
animated movie based on a beloved Japanese
folk tale.

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:10.660
In the film, a bamboo cutter finds a girl
inside a bamboo shoot, whom he names Kaguya.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:15.980
Realizing that the girl is divine, he moves
Kaguya to a mansion in the capital where she

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:20.080
is trained to become a noble lady, despite
Kaguya's growing discomfort.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:24.840
The Tale of the Princess Kaguya is without
a doubt one of Studio Ghibli's most visually

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.000
unique works.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:31.780
With distinct animation and style, the film
is an incredible experience from start to

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:32.280
finish.

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:38.520
Arguably the most well-known of the Studio
Ghibli films, Spirited Away follows Chihiro

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:43.880
as she works to save her parents, who unknowingly
trespassed into the world of spirits.

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:49.420
As punishment for stealing food, Chihiro's
parents are transformed into pigs by the powerful

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:50.860
witch Yubaba.

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:56.940
While working at a bathhouse to save her family,
Chihiro learns determination, how to assert

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:59.000
herself, and the value of compassion.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:03.820
Spirited Away is absolutely gorgeous, with
masterful animation and heartfelt character

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:04.520
designs.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:10.060
The fantastic visuals, accompanied by the
film's colorful cast of creative, lovable

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:14.320
characters, solidifies Spirited Away as one
of the most beloved animated films of all

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:14.820
time.

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:22.140
Taking place in Japan during World War II,
Grave of the Fireflies follows Seita and Setsuko,

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.940
siblings who manage to survive a firebombing
that destroys their home.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:31.680
Thrust into the role of a parent, Seita must
find a way to feed himself and his sister

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.040
in the midst of rapidly shrinking supplies.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:39.060
Grave of the Fireflies is unique in that it
reveals the main character's deaths at the

00:17:39.060 --> 00:17:40.100
beginning of the film.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:45.900
The remainder of the runtime is told through
a flashback that contextualizes Seita's death

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.840
and the hardships he was forced to endure.

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:53.700
Ultimately, the film is a grim and heartbreaking
experience that bears far more weight than

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.560
any other Studio Ghibli movie.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:18:01.680
In the end, Seita and Setsuko are innocent
children whose lives are destroyed by a war

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.940
they had no say in.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:08.720
In a post-war society, no one can provide
for these children, forcing Seita into an

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.500
adult role he is largely unprepared to handle.

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:16.720
While Grave of the Fireflies may prove too
difficult for some viewers to endure, the

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.360
film's message about war and tragedy is powerful.

